        "font" : "SimSun",
        "font size" : 12.0,
        "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
        "content" : "操作为核心目标，功能需求围绕用户使用全流程展开，具体如下："
      }, {
        "type" : "paragraph",
        "pdfua_tag" : "P",
        "id" : 4,
        "page number" : 20,
