    "font" : "SimSun",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "量其临床实用价值的三项核心性能指标。结合眼底医学影像分析的特点以及基层医疗机 构硬件条件有限的实际情况，系统需要满足以下性能要求："
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 14,
    "level" : "2",
    "page number" : 20,
    "bounding box" : [ 94.92, 169.754, 524.4, 346.484 ],
    "numbering style" : "arabic numbers",
    "number of list items" : 3,
    "list items" : [ {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
